rity semantics: conflict refusal alone versus required union/winner derivation, treatment of zero-lease, parked copies and tombstones, explicit-source admission and required read failures. Check finding3 new AuthoritativeStatus/List actually consume validated required facts and emit the prescribed whole-read refusals, with low-level diagnostic APIs clearly bounded. Check finding4 qualifying narrowing at every required gate: producer says revised record mutant now only changes refusal to a later lease reason; assess exactly what it proves. Prior renamed-record mutant SURVIVED; ensure durable same-instrument control/evidence and final count claims are truthful. Do not demand generic reruns of complete exact-candidate evidence, but use targeted adversarial probes for unresolved semantics.\n6|\n7|Require normal live merged reviewer checklist and actual verdict. Do not edit product files, waive scope, hand-commit or land. Changes requested routes back to-dev; accept_cr only if the whole assigned requirement is independently established. Preserve settled predecessor/selector cases unless the new delta affects them.","final_result":true}}}
