{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c479","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0886a-f946-7ee0-9ec1-744b6874e305"},"sequence":151,"recorded_at":1780531400000297,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"a5c7b7f2-5904-46fe-8e20-ce6e123abb19","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"a5c7b7f2-5904-46fe-8e20-ce6e123abb19","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"a5c7b7f2-5904-46fe-8e20-ce6e123abb19"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0886b-386e-71c0-a682-96fe7cb1196f"},"task_id":"01a0886b-386e-71c0-a682-96fe7cb1196f","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0886b-386e-71c0-a682-96fe7cb1196f","chunk":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/resources/TASK-260830-21gygk/TASK-260830-21gygk_rework-rev3.md`.\n1|Implement full rework after CR revision3 independent review for TASK-260830-21gygk. Read TASK-260830-21gygk_review-verdict-rev3.md and extract attached review-evidence-rev3.tar.gz into task scratch. The previous rework did NOT close the lease/union/summary requirements. Preserve all prior useful fixes and full shared-layer scope; no new product decision is needed.\n2|\n3|Start by converting the reviewer semantic probes into real regression gates. The earlier field-presence test admitted a false fix: the new gate MUST feed an actual canonicaljson-validated Lease Record through a supported production acquisition path and compare its actual object digest, plus reject a different envelope-attestation digest. Keep these gates failing until real integration exists.\n4|\n5|1. DELETE the substitution of a four-field fingerprint for lease_record_id. Implement actual Lease Record acquisition/admission in the shared repository/query layer as needed: validate closed schema and canonical self identity with existing canonicaljson, bind the exact winning record digest, derive positive tuple and all required heads from those same admitted records. Expose a supported production input/storage/read path, not a test-only oracle or fabricated storage path. Test missing/changed record, same-record facts and substitution. No claim of local attestation, compatibility or missing dependency authorizes a different object identity.\n6|2. Implement real complete authority union and deterministic greatest(epoch,lease_id) winner, retaining losing histories. A lagging epoch1 replica beside epoch2 local is valid and must allow fresh BuildPlan; equality of every copy is wrong. Bind all actual lease/event/tombstone heads used, validate unreadable/parked/corrupt observations without treating unknown as absence, preserve explicit provenance and no name retargeting. Keep cross-source immutable-record conflict/refusal tests.\n7|3. Complete authoritative summaries: required workspace_status, validated CapabilitySummary values, warnings, process_present boolean for status and owner_host_name1..64. Unknown required observations MUST refuse selector_observation_unavailable; established absence/empty capabilities is distinct and can be valid. Use real validated facts through supported APIs; refuse whole mixed lists when any row is unrepresentable. Preserve bootstrap, host-metadata and checkpoint timestamp refusals and diagnostic low-level access.\n8|4. Repair and truthfully classify narrowing evidence. Reviewer N-record-nonempty SURVIVED; add meaningful validated changed-record evidence or prove exact downstream subsumption without claiming unauthorized acceptance from the survivor alone. Preserve same-instrument SURVIVED control, named behavioral KILLED evidence and exact tested source snapshots/digests. Counts must be rederived from final manifest (prior manifest35N+3B=38, not claimed33N+3B). Fix all outcome/README/TRACEABILITY semantic and completion claims. A later error-reason change proves ordering only, not all record admission.\n9|\n10|Use existing canonical validators and reducer rules rather than inventing duplicate autho