{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c739","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0886a-f946-7ee0-9ec1-744b6874e305"},"sequence":503,"recorded_at":1780531400001001,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"a5c7b7f2-5904-46fe-8e20-ce6e123abb19","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"a5c7b7f2-5904-46fe-8e20-ce6e123abb19","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"a5c7b7f2-5904-46fe-8e20-ce6e123abb19"},"call_id":"call_01a0886bb08f7082b84ff5d642ba7980","text":"Read text file `internal/specdoc/SPEC.v0.6.0.md`.\n(12132 line(s) above)\n12133|into a default relation):\n12134|\n12135|| Plan member | Disposition | Independent fact and transformation, or endpoint-local evidence |\n12136|| --- | --- | --- |\n12137|| selector_version | endpoint-local observation | Constant 1.0.0; plan equals current via revalidate; no argv fact beyond version admission |\n12138|| selector | independent invocation fact (initiator only) | Initiator plan.selector equals the literal selection.selector single argument, even when another spelling resolves to the same UUID; receiver selector stays endpoint-local |\n12139|| session_id | independent invocation fact | Initiator plan.session_id equals resolved selection session_id; logs receiver plan.session_id equals the same resolved session_id; attach receiver session binds via expected lease admission plus revalidate, never via initiator equality; attach initiator session/record are jointly verified with owner exact-ID admission (a session-only divergence also changes the admitted record), logs isolates each clause |\n12140|| session_record_id | independent invocation fact | Same endpoints as session_id, against resolved session_record_id digest; same joint owner-admission note for attach, isolated caller narrowing on logs |\n12141|| source_host_id | independent invocation fact (initiator only) | Initiator plan.source_host_id equals resolved source_host_id; receiver source stays endpoint-local (valid distinct-source positives keep differing hosts) |\n12142|| source_alias | independent invocation fact (initiator only) | Initiator plan.source_alias equals the alias of the actually selected source (null for local); diagnostic label, never identity; receiver alias stays endpoint-local |\n12143|| source_index_digest | endpoint-local observation | Digest of the validated index read; no independent synthetic recomputation; plan equals current via revalidate; per-row changed/missing vectors |\n12144|| configuration_digest | endpoint-local observation | Digest of effective configuration; same evidence as source_index_digest |\n12145|| lease_record_id | endpoint-local observation | Winning lease digest; plan equals current via revalidate plus receiver expected admission; per-row vectors |\n12146|| lease_epoch | endpoint-local observation | Same evidence as lease_record_id |\n12147|| lease_id | endpoint-local observation | Same evidence as lease_record_id |\n12148|| owner_host_id | endpoint-local observation | Same evidence as lease_record_id; HOST derives from winning owner, never source |\n12149|| authority_heads | endpoint-local observation | Same evidence as lease_record_id |\n12150|| action | independent invocation fact (per endpoint) | Each end plan.action equals its actual route (attach/logs); both-ends-agreeing vectors prove cross-equality never counts |\n12151|| destination_host_id | independent invocation fact (per endpoint) | Attach: each end null (no destination argument); logs: each end equals the actual explicit --peer host per-endpoint; both-agreeing vectors prove cross-equality never counts |\n12152|| expectation_digest | endpoint-local observation | Digest binding action expectations; plan equals current via revalidate; per-row vectors |\n12153|\n12154|Synthetic digests are never independently recomputed to manufacture authority:\n12155|endpoint-local digest/lease/authority/expectation facts are validated by\n12156|plan/current equality (revalidate) at every applicable boundary plus receiver\n12157|expected admission, with per-row changed/missing witnesses. Temporal execution\n12158|(that a retry/resume actually re-ran) is a runtime prerequisite outside this\n12159|source evaluator. The denominator is closed at 159 divergence witnesses derived\n12160|directly from the 26-row composed context inventory joined with the member\n12161|disposition above: every applicable independent fact at every source-derived\n12162|composed route/endpoint/boundary/scope context, per endpoint, plus\n12163|both-ends-agreeing vectors for action/destination at every such context (and\n12164|initiator selection agreement vectors where both ends wrong still refuse via\n12165|the initiator check). Pre-effect, fencing and projection boundaries carry their\n12166|own invocation-binding witnesses with the context boundary set to pre-effect,\n12167|fencing or projection; plan/current revalidation alone cannot substitute for\n12168|this binding because two agreeing copies of a wrong plan never prove the actual\n12169|invocation. Invocation binding is checked unconditionally at every applicable\n12170|dispatch, admission, pre-effect, fencing, projection, retry and resume point,\n12171|so single-context narrowing at any one point is detected while all other points\n12172|still check.\n12173|\n12174|| Composed route | Plan side | Scope | Invocation fact | Plan field | Required relation | Divergence witness |\n12175|| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n12176|| attach | initiator | initial | route attach | action | equals attach | <code>SEL-CASE-remote-initiator-action-mismatch</code> |\n12177|| attach | initiator | initial | no destination argument | destination_host_id | is null | <code>SEL-CASE-remote-initiator-destination-mismatch</code> |\n12178|| attach | initiator | initial | literal invocation selector | selector | equals selection.selector | <code>SEL-CASE-remote-initiator-selector-mismatch</code> 